s nº 9.610/98. Qualquer violação será tratada legalmente.', 1573.06, 1148.34, NULL, 'Spare Parts and Accessories for Vehicles > Spare Parts for Automobiles > Suspension and Steering', 'https://cf.shopee.com.br/file/br-11134207-81ztn-mkjnikkvw8w022', 'https://shope.ee/an_redir?origin_link=https%3A%2F%2Fshopee.com.br%2Fproduct%2F349667948%2F23194448148', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-28T02:11:31.708458+00:00');
