pee.com.br/file/sg-11134201-824gu-mekis6mw20p091', 'https://shope.ee/an_redir?origin_link=https%3A%2F%2Fshopee.com.br%2Fproduct%2F1355263989%2F23198896282', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-28T02:11:31.708458+00:00');
