L, 'Mom & Baby > Toys > Dolls & Stuffed Toys', 'https://cf.shopee.com.br/file/br-11134201-820m7-mqyd3dd9222s4f', 'https://shope.ee/an_redir?origin_link=https%3A%2F%2Fshopee.com.br%2Fproduct%2F497594085%2F41858421936', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-28T02:11:31.708458+00:00');
